# Each story is an illustration, not a source-based claim: it helps a reader relate the meaning given in the name's
# explanation to ordinary life. No human quality in a story is a measure of Allah's; the closing lines point from the
# small human picture to how much greater the name is. Draft, written with an AI assistant; pending scholarly review.
